        "card_9THAK9": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "initials": "DW",
            "description": "This is my second lot of NMN. I just feel so much better when I take it. I am 51 years old and I started to feel sluggish. I did extensive research and this product kept coming up. At first I was put off by the price but then again you get what you pay for! This particular brand seemed to be the most pure form of NMN. Anyway, I’ve been on it 3 months, I take 2 scoops a day directly under my tongue and let it dissolve. Within 3 months my hair is growing, I can’t remember the last time I had pain in my joints, my skin looks healthy and generally I feel great! This month I started taking it with resveratrol and that gives me such an energy boost. So to round it off — ignore the price as it’s worth every penny! I don’t normally leave reviews but I had to for this.",
