          }
        },
        "card_bEE7jX": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "initials": "TC",
            "description": "I’ve been taking NMN 250mg capsules x 2 daily for around 7 weeks now. I wasn’t sure much was happening initially but around the 3-4 week mark I noticed that I was sleeping better. Falling asleep faster and staying asleep all night (which as a menopausal woman is amazing) and I also noticed that my nails have stopped splitting and breaking and are actually growing again and are much stronger. For those 2 things alone I decided to persevere. I was yet to see any major differences to my energy or skin. Last weekend I decided to up my dose to 750mg daily after doing some research about dose and age and I am impressed! I’ve been waking up feeling refreshed and alert which is unheard of for me, and I’ve had much more energy this week than for a very long time. I’ve also noticed I have more stamina when am out walking. I met a friend at the weekend who told me that I look younger than ever and I hadn’t even told her about taking NMN! I am delighted with the results in the first week of increasing my dose. I’ve had no side effects at all from these supplements which confirms to me their high quality. I’ve since recommended them to my friend!",
            "name": "Trusted Customer"
          }
        },
        "card_KQAyYU": {
